  'safe-passage':['broadSafeCorridor','The complete native description defines a protected terrain section 10 feet wide, 10 feet tall and 60 feet long, despite structured area being null. Protective abjuration signs tile this corridor footprint; actual route and origin need placed-template context. No damage, removed difficult terrain or prematurely collapsed hazards.'],
