  'favorable-review':['broadPraise','Speech about a chosen subject becomes praise. Mouth-level runes curl upward; ordinary failure need not change attitude, so no forced love or bow.'],
  'impart-empathy':['broadSocialSense','An animal understands social cues. Eye and heart impressions appear near the head without pretending willingness to help or changing the creature type.'],
  'infectious-ennui':['broadEnnui','Mental lethargy settles on the primary target. Secondary transmission occurs on a later turn; no immediate chain or fall is invented.'],
  'invent-code':['broadCode','A willing group gains a shared private code. Three arranged vocabulary signs appear at participants; this is not public translation or a sonic spell.'],
  'laughing-fit':['broadLaughter','Upper-body laughter and soft sound ripples distinguish this from mental damage. Prone belongs only to a critical failure and is not pre-resolved.'],
  'manifestation-of-spirits':['broadSpiritMemory','Illusory spirits crowd the target mind. Local spectral veils suggest the personal visions; they are not actual summoned creatures or a damaging aura.'],
  'mental-map':['broadMentalMap','Location memories flow from target back to caster. The learned map and optional critical-failure erasure are not fabricated on canvas.'],
  'overwhelming-memory':['broadChosenMemory','The caster chooses gleeful, romantic, terrifying or tragic memory. Neutral layered memory impressions preserve that unresolved choice instead of always showing fear.'],
  'roaring-applause':['broadApplause','Paired hand-level glints and rising sound rings suggest cheers and applause. No generic lightning jolt or physical fall.'],
  'shift-blame':['broadBlame','A reaction edits the remembered responsible creature. Overlapping memory impressions illustrate substitution; the independently chosen blamed participant is not guessed.'],
  'spiritual-anamnesis':['broadPastLife','An earlier life intrudes into the present. A spiritual duplicate rises behind the recipient; undead/extraplanar save adjustment remains rules.'],
  stupefy:['broadDullMind','The target mind dulls. A blurred head impression and small unfocused stars replace a full-body attack or fear vision.'],
  'subjugate-undead':['broadUndeadCommand','A necromantic command seal is attempted on one undead. The binding is finite and symbolic; minion control and immunity require the native save.'],
  'sudden-recollection':['broadLatentMemory','Knowledge is planted or suppressed until a chosen later trigger. Rune fragments seal inward at casting; no premature revelation or recall is played.'],
  'timely-tutor':['broadAstralTutor','Physical contact connects an eidolon or familiar to the Akashic psychic library. A small library portal and matching knowledge marks illustrate the connection, not attack or movement.'],
