  'with-friends-like-these':['broadDiscord','Two targets receive diverging social impressions. No caster-target friendship bond, immediate forced separation or assumed save result.'],
  'word-of-freedom':['broadFreedomWord','A liberating word suppresses a selected mental or physical restriction. A word pulse opens outward rather than assuming every target is physically chained.'],
  'appeal-to-authority':['broadAuthority','A subtle mental likeness of an authority figure affects an impression. A restrained eye/seal cue avoids summoning a real NPC or forcing obedience.'],
  befuddle:['broadBefuddle','Opposing thought signs cross around unfocused stars. Confusion is a critical-failure branch, so no random forced movement occurs.'],
  'celestial-accord':['broadAccord','Two creatures in conflict calm. Matching gentle head marks replace wound healing or a caster-target emotional bond.'],
  'charming-touch':['broadAttraction','One touched recipient receives a small attraction mark. Friendliness and awareness depend on the save; no forced body motion.'],
  'déjà-vu':['broadReplay','A short translucent repetition evokes repeating the next turn again. No actual actions, teleport or extra attack are executed now.'],
  'elysian-whimsy':['broadWhimsy','Four possible later whimsical outcomes require the native roll. Loose stars and fluttering impressions convey potential without blindly choosing dancing, singing or charity.'],
  'guided-introspection':['broadIntrospection','Ordered inner circles evoke a willing subject reflecting on emotion and fear. This strengthens future defenses; no existing condition is falsely cleansed now.'],
  'hearts-hook':['broadHeartHook','Two targets feel inward attraction and may approach each other on a later turn. Paired local heart marks distinguish this from caster-target love or actual movement.'],
  'information-overload':['broadInformation','Several irrelevant knowledge fragments cascade around the head, ending in small unfocused stars. No damaging ray or musical performance.'],
  'join-pasts':['broadSharedPast','Two willing foreheads share nonverbal past experience. Matching eye impressions and memory veils avoid spoken-code letters and one-way Mindlink.'],
  'message-rune':['broadMessageMark','A small personal rune stores a telepathic message for a later trigger. The mark is quiet and local; the message is not audibly played at casting.'],
  mindlink:['broadMindlink','A willing touched target receives information from caster once. A single outward strand and recipient eye cue avoid an ongoing bidirectional emotional bond.'],
  schadenfreude:['broadSmugness','Smug amusement distracts foes following the caster critical failure. A brief head glint and mild wobble replace replaying the failed attack.'],
  'share-lore':['broadLore','Ordered knowledge symbols reach willing recipients. It grants selected training without flooding them with confusing unrelated information.'],
  tame:['broadTaming','Comforting natural signs and a small heart cue suggest a nonhostile domesticated animal approach. No immediate bow, attack, wild-beast domination or attitude success is assumed.'],
  'touch-of-obedience':['broadObedience','A hand-level seal and restrained thought threads weaken will. No kneeling; prone belongs only to critical failure.'],
  'uplifting-overture':['broadOverture','Music at caster prepares a future Aid; a recipient glint illustrates encouragement. No wound healing or future successful check is played.'],
  'veil-of-dreams':['broadDreamVeil','Descending dream stars and head haze evoke drowsy daydreams. The spell does not impose sleep or unconsciousness, so the real token remains upright.'],
  'wilding-word':['broadWildWarning','A patron growl warns an animal fungus or plant. Head-level warning eyes and caster voice rings do not apply the sickness that occurs only if the target later harms caster.'],

  'aberrant-form':['broadAberrantForm','Grotesque tentacular material and an asymmetric echo illustrate aberrant transformation. The chosen chuul/gogiteth/gug/ofalth is not inferred; exact creature artwork is unavailable.'],
